  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Concept Used:\n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n(3)/(4) ÷ (5)/(12) - (1)/(3) × (9)/(5) ( (2)/(3) ÷ (1)/(3) - 1 )\n\n⇒3/4 ÷ 5/12 – 1/3 × 9/5 × (2/3 × 3/1 – 1)\n\n⇒ 3/4 ÷ 5/12 – 1/3 × 9/5 × (2 – 1)\n\n⇒ 3/4 ÷ 5/12 – 1/3 × 9/5 × 1\n\n⇒ 3/4 ÷ 5/12 – 1/3 × 9/5\n\n⇒ 3/4 × 12/5 – 1/3 × 9/5\n\n⇒ 9/5 – 1/3 × 9/5\n\n⇒ 9/5 – 3/5\n\n⇒ 6/5\n\n**∴ The required value is (6)/(5)**\n\n4",
